<surname>Fujii</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Matsumoto</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Ohnishi</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Takeya</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><article-title>Pulmonary tumor thrombotic microangiopathy resulting from metastatic signet ring cell carcinoma of the stomach</article-title><source>Pathol Int</source><year>2007</year><volume>57</volume><issue>6</issue><fpage>383</fpage><lpage>387</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1111/j.1440-1827.2007.02111.x</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17539970</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B10"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Roberts</surname><given-names>KE</given-names></name><name><surname>Hamele-Bena</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Saqi</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Stein</surname><given-names>CA</given-names></name><name><surname>Cole</surname><given-names>RP</given-names></name><article-title>Pulmonary tumor embolism: a review of the literature</article-title><source>Am J Med</source><year>2003</year><volume>115</volume><issue>3</issue><fpage>228</fpage><lpage>232</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0002-9343(03)00305-X</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12935829</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B11"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Franquet</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Gim&#x000e9;nez</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Prats</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Rodr&#x000ed;guez-Arias</surname><given-names>JM</given-names></name><name><surname>Rodr&#x000ed;guez</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><article-title>Thrombotic microangiopathy of pulmonary tumors: a vascular cause of tree-in-bud pattern on CT</article-title><source>AJR Am J Roentgenol</source><year>2002</year><volume>179</volume><issue>4</issue><fpage>897</fpage><lpage>899</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12239033</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B12"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Tack</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Nollevaux</surname><given-names>M-C</given-names></name><name><surname>Gevenois</surname><given-names>PA</given-names></name><article-title>Tree-in- bud pattern in neoplastic pulmonary emboli</article-title><source>AJR Am J Roentgenol</source><year>2001</year><volume>176</volume><fpage>1421</fpage><lpage>1422</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11373205</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>